  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Delight in water and mountain Immortal Gu needs large amounts of earth qi, water qi, and some laughter stones. Laughter stones are very rare goods and are hardly seen in treasure yellow heaven. Lang Ya land spirit once owned laughter stones, but used them up when refining Gu. In the same feeding survey, Worldly Wave Trace needs underworld jellyfish and deepsea lightning eels, Calamity Beckoning needs six headed snake blood, and Rising Azure Cloud needs cloud dragon scales and wind scythe bird eyeballs; those foods are covered on underworld jellyfish, deepsea lightning eels, six headed snake blood, cloud dragon scales, and wind scythe bird eyeballs.",
      "chapters": [
        672
      ],
